  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcdd6853587a57ecb2af61ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若把你那面罩拿掉，会发生什么事？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c77a53239e6b7fd693f634ce6b96749959b6416e24c1ae3fa604df225d49b3a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0f9fef08c7098187e0b7867",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有只鸟一直在你头上盘旋呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a43fc1d9d1985bb0eae7cedcdb0a453f6aa4c499b4b7015f84b04ce9cb8b0b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52027cac595e05b3f773f7f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对竞争对手们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a33aa43de0b4c1a16896ff2b811a35f8906cdb32171890bfa12632e3a687cdc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a34a0167b436eff37d48021",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "觉得最辛苦的训练是什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "71bc033852587690846b8662d86cbfac3c299beeeb9fd773b53a23a0123e3eff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f305061fb1f2f71b053d79e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请问目前状态大概达到百分之几呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec6a9bf23e285a06e9382c4de63f3cfe742d2c10c0be1edb7d9febbf84df85ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa9881c21ad5d31a120d27f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次有可以称得上是劲敌的成员吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1743c0be863361c9356834cb02cc663cc92de842d92cf13395b1167392a0782",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4212b67011b53207b981f65f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "视这场竞赛的结果，也有可能前往国外挑战？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7194d36e5bd298cdb31c7b6884451feb8ec4d482354090040a50a1956195519",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b14ce98f237b651f39cfd943",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有传闻说你会在休息室吃饭团？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ebe55341b5a818ce036aab0322bc9b3babfd37c6ad8c1a41580c5cd82b1cc13",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "230"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56be75b5a5bfb9f65f6b0545",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有必胜方法吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "940cc73da55ff87dda08f4da2909d0262690150d90dd1939346f535da4b08c1b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a2297f1ddf277348c610b49",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请以学生会长的身份对学园的大家说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b08f40d03e9fce9e2578080460aac2543759f7fb381016a6cbc5f1797327186",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "232"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28186f858871bf2827dfe648",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛前的致胜料理吃了什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "977ce0c7615a51c57dff528bc9bedf1dc33650d36215b553d98df2851f2f32aa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "233"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f954e06778bf54c476600902",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次的竞赛，有令你感到不安的要素吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab2e0363d1b0616fd641af78dd0e863d213e62d98f5f92ee99c243f3fd015654",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "234"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c68614558a4aeff36ce8cce5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有做什么事祈求好运吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e37f432d02ff939eccdce4da382f034142b2754134b534240d3a8a167a5a8b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "235"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d8ef322c2735617b65359cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "兼顾学生会与竞赛最让你感到辛苦的是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "342004631ee2aab7010600f120a9124cb1dc42ed6f86b0a08525b65e6fbbaf36",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "236"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa86497ff3af1d79b6492e9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们不会紧张的诀窍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59732d13f75b8d0e7fc6f69c9885498df4f4e48c077afad712c87913d5ea4185",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "237"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:405b31a4d0ca46822c3e0bd0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对于本次战场的局势，你有何看法？",
      "source_fingerprint": "04f5d82d980377ff277a0274f03b13bde173f184012a5666000c7c1989f168d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "238"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1d48681059d47f2be4f106a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在今天的竞赛当中，你最关注谁呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "730c865d805b9fa91a94a23df87e73266018693e5afd8a4a16048a040d6f0c62",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "239"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db9c82230119e47f9e71b72e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次有锁定的选手吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b780314014a4d0c8a7a54b9ab0513b59fc154524918d733512612802557ae29d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "24"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:721f595262eadf884cf7fe55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你觉得获得胜利的关键是什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab6f0f6923974db5a4ee56377b83affcaa6889a878fe6abbf9aed76532e60449",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "240"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3bc75cfb2b8a568bdd4fb55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近的钓鱼成果如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0cd6ded6970e05862f031de7fb4e1298f395bd3ab1ec4fbc5129af2ec8bb9fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cccdc0b8c693a1774ed00d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跟你要好的猫咪过得还好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eaae4f30d4c4a5db10801f122cbfb06cd85f9574aa075883038e16af9eab7f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "242"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cfbd42012da15e5773efb9a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们胜利的秘诀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "101ef869ca1844732c0caef7d06b423da699e8c32dcff4849b9677c43475577e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "243"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb3e68081732a3b80f6835be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在竞赛中会期待什么样的发展？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b6f21dd6f582fb5f4fee8f042cda84b3371637acfc3fe3e43ffd680d88d1ddd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "244"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3be65a4cc901147cd72abf7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "到目前为止做过最辛苦的训练是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "decad934505ae29b9577efbedff19860a519088133afb3cd025a638308ec3b1c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "245"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c20344c6dc21b527006f599",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "期待你展现如闪电般一鸣惊人的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "732d8bd1a0ed2de4a20d055d51c89977f8c5862813835be1a79a548061b398c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "246"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19154699af8c3c166eb4c01b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们你对今天竞赛的期许。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dff7582ada1fd2dd53d406300cb564867ca0169783bc55164aac2300dca5186",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "247"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d2ab3385480c4166d0f5505",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "日本的竞赛感觉如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4592bfee947a946d862619ace242a4132ffa4a58039d19082f1809a5af8f3984",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "248"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b65cdcc087ad85ead2e016f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说你很喜欢拉面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86698c4c5ac8be31a802ab3649d99d2ce4b1e1ea542309c1447d6447faa924c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "249"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29089ab189db10787bf5caf3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目前状态可在满分100分中拿到几分？",
